<title>USA: Virginia Gas buys propane business.</title>
<headline>Virginia Gas buys propane business.</headline>
<dateline>ABINGDON, Va. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virginia Gas Co said Friday it acquired a portion of Blue Grass Oils Inc's propane business for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Virginia Gas said the acquistion will expand its propane presence in southwest Virginia, adding 1,200 customers and 454,000 gallons of annual sales to the company's propane business.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
